  "description": "Koda Plus is built to inspire big-kid confidence and can keep up with their growing sense of adventure. Crafted with a lightweight aluminum frame, rust-free components, and internal cable routing, this kids bike is sleek, easy to maneuver, and ready to handle anything. With a minimum seat height of just 21.9\" and easily adjustable seat, handlebars, and brake levers, they’ll experience a perfectly comfortable fit ride after ride (even through their biggest growth spurts). Equipped with our premium EasySafe front and rear V-brakes, fully aluminum levers, and tool-free reach adjustment, this kids bike delivers smooth, reliable stopping power for small hands. With Koda Plus, your growing rider will enjoy the perfect blend of safety, comfort, and effortless handling, making it their go-to bike for every milestone on two wheels.",
